flowchart TD
    accTitle: PodVigil Modal managed lifecycle
    accDescr: The local worker creates one owned Sandbox and Volume. Normal recovery verifies terminal compute twice, backs up every file, then deletes storage. Uncertainty retains resources for explicit recovery. No-workload cleanup requires recorded proof, not a timeout alone.

    A["Validate inputs, limits and estimate<br/>Arm worker; match local credentials"] --> B["Build image; record create intents<br/>Create owned Volume and Sandbox"]
    B --> C["Commit runtime start gate<br/>Before any workload execution"]
    C --> D["Run with fixed time limits<br/>Checkpoint, stop children, publish manifest"]
    D --> E["Verify compute stopped<br/>Owned receipt and two terminal reads"]
    C -. "no workload start" .-> E
    E --> F{"Complete and consistent<br/>output manifest?"}
    F -->|yes| G["Back up every file<br/>Check manifest bytes, hashes and second reads"]
    F -->|no| H{"Recorded no-start protocol<br/>No gate; exact uploaded inventory?"}
    H -->|yes| I["Back up inputs; verify upload hashes<br/>Eligible for no_capacity after cleanup"]
    G --> J["Flush files and POSIX directories<br/>Save durable backup receipt"]
    I --> J
    J --> K["Delete Volume by receipted ID<br/>Confirm absence twice; record result"]
    K --> L["Keep verified local backup<br/>Storage billing can lag deletion"]

    A -. "worker records" .-> O[("Local ledger only<br/>Offline status, wait, list and logs")]
    B -. "create unresolved" .-> M["Preserve receipts and resources<br/>No create retry; explicit recovery"]
    E -. "stop unverified" .-> M
    H -->|no| N["Storage cleanup unverified<br/>Keep ledger for explicit recovery"]
    G -. "verification fails" .-> N
    J -. "durability fails" .-> N
    K -. "absence unverified" .-> N

    classDef retained fill:#fff5dc,stroke:#b58a25,color:#483a18
    class M,N retained
